  "description": "Stop provisioning for worst case. RingBufferPlus is a bounded, thread-safe pool for any expensive-to-create resource - database connections, RabbitMQ channels, HTTP clients. Capacity scales up and down automatically to match real demand (or pin it manually), with native OpenTelemetry metrics and tracing built in, no extra dependency. Targets .NET 8, 9, and 10. MIT-licensed.",
